{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"isVolatile"}],"fragments":[{"text":"isVolatile","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"title":"isVolatile","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNSource(py)isVolatile"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnsource\/isvolatile"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"getter","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"=","kind":"text"},{"text":"isVolatile","kind":"identifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setter","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"=","kind":"text"},{"text":"setVolatile:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BOOL","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isVolatile","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YES"},{"text":", tiles of this source are neither written to nor read from the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ambient cache on disk, whatever the response’s "},{"code":"Cache-Control","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" header says;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"they are held in memory for as long as the map needs them. Use it for content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose terms forbid storing it, or that must not outlive the session. Other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resources, such as a TileJSON file the source is configured with, are still"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cached. The default is "},{"code":"NO","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set it before adding the source to a style, so that no tile is requested"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"under the old setting.","type":"text"}]}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSource"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSource\/isVolatile","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether the tiles this source loads are kept out of persistent storage."}],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNSource/isVolatile":{"title":"isVolatile","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether the tiles this source loads are kept out of persistent storage."}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnsource\/isvolatile","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"isVolatile","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSource\/isVolatile","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","title":"MapLibre","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle":{"title":"MLNStyle","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The proxy object for the current map style.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNStyle"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyl